1
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:17,100
B1 Listen to Millie and Toby talking about lunchtime at Sunshine Middle School and Toby's school in the USA and fill in the blanks in the table below.

2
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:23,730
Hey Toby, is our lunchtime different from yours in the USA?

3
00:00:23,730 --> 00:00:33,570
Yes, in the USA we only get half an hour for lunch, but here you get an hour and a half.

4
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:39,460
Oh yes, we have some time to relax after the meal.

5
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:42,600
Do you like the food in the dining hall?

6
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,270
I love it!

7
00:00:44,270 --> 00:00:52,850
The dining hall here is full of delicious hot food and there are different dishes every day.

8
00:00:52,850 --> 00:01:02,760
Back home, we only have a few to choose from, such as hamburgers, pizza, fried chicken and salad.

9
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:11,470
Sometimes we take our lunch to school in a lunchbox and eat it in the classroom. Really?

10
00:01:11,470 --> 00:01:15,210
What kind of food do you take to school?

11
00:01:15,210 --> 00:01:20,890
Just a sandwich and a snack like fruit or cookies.

12
00:01:20,890 --> 00:01:26,200
Oh, so you can choose food to your taste here?

13
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:27,780
Yes, it's great!
